The important part of that solution is this:

Vercel
   ↓
@vercel/python
   ↓
config/wsgi.py
   ↓
Django application
   ↓
/api/auth/me/

Your current deployment is effectively doing:

Vercel
   ↓
files/folders
   ↓
404












